ex:X1 a backlog:ScopeExclusion ; rdfs:label "Deployment to Ethereum mainnet or any network that costs real money"@en ; backlog:hasExclusionRationale "The club has no budget; the Sepolia testnet shows the same mechanism at zero cost." .
ex:X2 a backlog:ScopeExclusion ; rdfs:label "Storing personal data (names, student numbers) on the blockchain"@en ; backlog:hasExclusionRationale "On-chain data cannot be deleted, which conflicts with KVKK; only a salted hash goes on chain." .
ex:X3 a backlog:ScopeExclusion ; rdfs:label "Certificates for official university diplomas or transcripts"@en ; backlog:hasExclusionRationale "Those belong to the Registrar's Office and need legal approval far outside a one-term project." .
